      "content": "it's not like i'm struggling to breathe or anything, it just feels kinda weird and heavy when i swallow. i really dont want to spend all night in the er if i can help it lol. i have a few more benadryl in the cabinet though, can i just take two or three at once to make sure the hives go away? is that safe?",
