      "content": "wait, seizures? that sounds way too intense for just an allergy. i really think it's just the pollen. i've had hay fever for years and it always gets itchy like this. the throat thing is definitely just from the constant clearing and coughing. if i just take a double dose of a different antihistamine like Claritin instead, would that be safer to just knock it out tonight so i can sleep? i really can't afford a hospital bill right now.",
